Firefox lets you view the source and save it as another file. You can then 
modify it with the editor of your choice. Firefox 1.6a1 and later let you 
set an external editor to be used by the 'view source' command. What it 
won't do though is to let you edit the copy of the page being displayed by 
the browser (if that is what you meant).


